Package: AIRate
Title: Score content With LLM by storing element in a database and using
    AI to give a relevence score.
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Mathieu", "Genu", , "mathieu.genu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The Goal is to ease the use of IA to give a score to
    different type of content (posts, articles, job offer) by storing
    information in a postgres database and score content according to a
    profile defined by the user.
